remarks:
Issue: The return of income filed by the Assessee is processed and intimation under section 143(1) has been issued to the Company. However, there are discrepancies in processing of return as per the intimation under section 143(1).

However, the Assessee is unable to file the request for reprocess of return under the ‘Rectification’ tab of the income tax portal as the income tax portal shows the following error &quot;The Latest Return filed by you is under processing. Request you to kindly wait till the same gets processed.&quot;
However, the return of income by the Assessee has been processed on 28 December 2022.

